BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pikes-peak-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART:20260920T070000Z
DTEND:20260920T110000Z
SUMMARY:Pikes Peak Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Known as 'America's Ultimate Challenge\,' this race ascends to the 14\,115-foot summit of Pikes Peak before descending back to Manitou Springs. It is one of the most physically demanding marathons in the world due to the 7\,800-foot vertical climb.
LOCATION:Manitou Ave (City Hall)\, Manitou Springs\, CO 80829
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:crested-butte-ultra-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART:20260926T060000Z
DTEND:20260926T100000Z
SUMMARY:Crested Butte Ultra
DESCRIPTION:Crested Butte Ultra takes runners through the Gunnison National Forest on single track trails featuring beautiful mountain meadows\, stunning mountain ridges\, wildflowers\, and fall foliage. The race offers three distance options (35K\, 55K\, and 50 Mile) with elevation gains ranging from 2\,280' to 8\,301' depending on distance selected.
LOCATION:Crested Butte Community School\, 818 Red Lady Avenue\, Crested Butte\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:golden-leaf-half-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART:20260926T080000Z
DTEND:20260926T120000Z
SUMMARY:Golden Leaf Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The Golden Leaf Half Marathon\, presented by ACG\, is a bucket-list half marathon hosted by the Ute Mountaineer and the City of Aspen. The race starts from Fanny Hill in Snowmass and runs across the Government trail through beautiful Aspen groves\, finishing at Koch Lumber Park in downtown Aspen. Registration opens April 28\, 2026 at 10:00 AM and sells out quickly.
LOCATION:Fanny Hill in Snowmass to Koch Lumber Park\, Aspen\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
