SUMMARY:Cougar Ridge Classic 26K Trail Run
DESCRIPTION:Cougar Ridge Classic 26K - Vail to Minturn Running Race and Cougar Cub 14K Race. Part of the Vail Trail Running Series.
LOCATION:352 E Meadow Dr.\, Vail\, CO (Start) / 101113 Williams St.\, Minturn\, CO (Finish)
