SUMMARY:Rim to Rim Royal Gorge Races
DESCRIPTION:Scenic races including a 5K road run\, an 8-mile trail run\, and a half marathon trail run through the foothills and across the majestic Royal Gorge Bridge. The event also features a free 'Dinosaur Dash' kids race and virtual options.
LOCATION:Royal Gorge Bridge\, Canon City\, CO
