SUMMARY:Windsor Marathon
DESCRIPTION:The Windsor Marathon events presented by Banner MD Anderson features multiple distance options starting and ending at The Island at Pelican Lakes. Race includes finisher lunch\, beverages\, finisher shirts and medals\, and an after party with food\, drinks\, music\, and kids zone. Part of the run.Windsor Race Series and a BOLDERBoulder Qualifier event.
