UID:durango-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART:20261011T073000Z
DTEND:20261011T113000Z
SUMMARY:Durango Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Inaugural Durango Marathon Weekend featuring scenic road races through one of Colorado's most beautiful mountain communities. Start and finish at Santa Rita Park along the Animas River with views of the San Juan Mountains\, peak fall foliage\, and crisp autumn temperatures. Course starts at approximately 6\,500 feet and reaches nearly 6\,900 feet at its highest point. A portion of race proceeds supports scholarships through the Durango Education Foundation.
LOCATION:111 South Camino Del Rio\, Durango\, CO 81301
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
