DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART:20261114T090000Z
DTEND:20261114T130000Z
SUMMARY:Longmont Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:The Longmont Turkey Trot is one of the fastest\, most scenic 10K and 2-mile courses in the area. Participants can run\, roll\, or walk past the finish line\, with a wheelchair division available for the 10K race. The event includes age-group and gender-based awards\, packet pick-up on Friday\, November 13\, and multiple registration options through RecTrac or RaceEntry.
LOCATION:Altona Middle School\, 4600 Clover Basin Dr\, Longmont\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
