SUMMARY:Turkey ROCK Trot 5k
DESCRIPTION:Plum Creek Church 22nd Annual Turkey ROCK Trot presented by CORE. Family-friendly 5K run/walk/stroll on Thanksgiving morning (November 26\, 2026) through downtown Castle Rock. Features live DJ at start line\, live music on course\, indoor health & wellness expo with 30+ vendors\, free kids activities\, and food/beverage options. FREE 1K Kids Dash at 8:30 AM. All proceeds benefit the Help&Hope Center. Early bird pricing: $40 through October 11th.
